OL,3,AIndia pledges $1.6bn to Nepal in reset
OL,4,Aof ties
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepal's Prime Minister Balen Shah has
OL,7,Frepeatedly called for his country to be
OL,8,Ftreated as an equal by its powerful
OL,9,Fneighbours. His first visit to the
OL,10,FIndian capital, Delhi, put that
OL,11,Fapproach to the test, as both sides
OL,12,Fsought to reset a relationship strained
OL,13,Fby years of friction.
OL,15,FThe contrast between the two leaders
OL,16,Fwas striking.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
