OL,3,AIndia pledges $1.6bn to Nepal in reset
OL,4,Aof ties
OL,5,
OL,6,FShah, 36, wearing his trademark black
OL,7,Fsuit and sunglasses, stood beside Prime
OL,8,FMinister Narendra Modi, 76, dressed in
OL,9,Fwhite. Shah rose to power after a wave
OL,10,Fof Gen Z-led protests toppled his
OL,11,Fpredecessor.
OL,13,FModi, meanwhile, is serving a third
OL,14,Fterm and has recently faced student-led
OL,15,Fprotests in India.
